# StreamVersion 1.2
# The message center opens under the viewport tool group's bell, closes from its own close
# button and reopens from the bell. The group and the card must never cover each other, whatever
# was clicked last: the reopened card used to come back UNDER the group, its close button hidden.
RenderEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
